#. module: ai_stock
#: model_terms:ai.prompt.button,prompt:ai_stock.ai_prompt_stock_move
msgid ""
"Search the Stock Moves (model_name: stock.move), and find the most common "
"move (the one with the highest count).\n"
"The result should include the name of the product moved (field_name: "
"product_id), the From location (field_name: location_id), the To location "
"(field_name: location_dest_id),\n"
"and the forecasted location if any (field_name: forecasted_location_id) of "
"this move, the sum of the quantity moved (field_name: product_qty) and the "
"total number of moves (count).\n"
"If no forecasted location, don' t add it to the result. Don't mention "
"model_name, field_name or any records ids in the response."
msgstr ""
"Cari Pergerakan Stok (model_name: stock.move), dan temukan pergerakan yang "
"paling umum (yang memiliki jumlah tertinggi).\n"
"Hasilnya harus mencakup nama produk yang dipindahkan (field_name: product_id)"
", lokasi asal (field_name: location_id), lokasi tujuan (field_name: "
"location_dest_id),\n"
"serta lokasi yang diperkirakan jika ada (field_name: forecasted_location_id) "
"dari pergerakan ini, jumlah total barang yang dipindahkan (field_name: "
"product_qty), dan jumlah total pergerakan (count).\n"
"Jika tidak ada lokasi yang diperkirakan, jangan sertakan dalam hasil. Jangan "
"sebutkan model_name, field_name, atau ID record apa pun dalam respons."

msgid ""
"Search the Stock Moves (model_name: stock.move), and find the most common "
"move (the one with the highest count).\n"
"The result should include the name of the product moved (field_name: "
"product_id), the From location (field_name: location_id), the To location "
"(field_name: location_dest_id),\n"
"and the final location if any (field_name: location_final_id) of this move, "
"the sum of the quantity moved (field_name: product_qty) and the total number "
"of moves (count).\n"
"If no final location, don' t add it to the result. Don't mention model_name, "
"field_name or any records ids in the response."
msgstr ""
"Cari Pergerakan Stok (model_name: stock.move), dan temukan pergerakan yang "
"paling banyak (dengan jumlah tertinggi).\n"
"Hasilnya harus mencakup nama produk yang dipindahkan (field_name: product_id)"
", lokasi Dari (field_name: location_id), lokasi Ke (field_name: "
"location_dest_id),\n"
"dan lokasi akhir jika ada (field_name: location_final_id) dari pergerakan "
"ini, jumlah kuantitas yang dipindahkan (field_name: product_qty), dan jumlah "
"total pergerakan (count).\n"
"Jika tidak ada lokasi akhir, jangan sertakan dalam hasil. Jangan sebutkan "
"model_name, field_name, atau record id dalam respons."
